  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your dwarven blood is strong.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dwarf Blooded<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your dwarven blood manifests further in the following ways. First, you gain a +2 racial bonus on saving throws against poison, spells, and spell-like abilities. Second, you gain a +4 racial bonus to your Combat Maneuver Defense when resisting a bull rush or trip attempt while standing on the ground.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc113\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
